OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers this
OL,6,Fevening will largely clear, with a dry
OL,7,Fnight following and long clear
OL,8,Fperiods. Winds gradually ease, but
OL,9,Fcoastal areas will stay fairly breezy.
OL,10,FSome patchy rain possible in the
OL,11,Fsoutheast overnight.
OL,12,
OL,13,CThursday:FMostly dry throughout the
OL,14,Fdaytime with some good sunny spells
OL,15,Fbetween patchy amounts of cloud.
OL,16,FChance of the odd afternoon shower in
OL,17,Fsouth. Moderate winds, occasionally
OL,18,Ffresh around west coasts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
