OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRather
OL,6,Fchangeable with showers or longer
OL,7,Fspells of rain on Friday, but
OL,8,Fgenerally drier on the weekend with
OL,9,Fbright spells and just the odd light
OL,10,Fshower possible.
